WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.760
I'm Jenna Fisher.
我是珍娜·费舍尔。

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:06.060
And I'm Angela Kinsey.
我是安吉拉·金赛。

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.340
We were on The Office together.
我们曾一起出演《办公室》。

4
00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:08.600
And we're best friends.
我们还是最好的朋友。

5
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.420
And now we're doing the Ultimate Office rewatch podcast just for you.
现在，我们专门为你制作了这档《办公室》终极重温播客。

6
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:19.400
Each week, we will break down an episode of The Office and give exclusive behind-the-scenes stories that only two people who were there can tell you.
每周，我们都会剖析一集《办公室》，并分享只有身临其境的我们才能告诉你的独家幕后故事。

7
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.540
We're The Office Ladies.
我们是《办公室》女士。

8
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:24.490
Hello, everyone.
大家好。

9
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:25.810
Hey there.
嘿，大家好。

10
00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:36.010
Today, we're talking about Christening, which is Season 7, Episode 7, written by Peter Oko and directed by Alex Hardcastle.
今天我们要聊的是《洗礼》，也就是第七季第七集，由彼得·奥科编剧，亚历克斯·哈德卡斯尔执导。

11
00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.470
How about a summary?
要不要来个剧情梗概？

12
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:39.610
I thought you'd never ask.
我就知道你会问。

13
00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:45.390
It is Cece Halpert's christening, and the whole office shows up to the dismay of Jim and Pam.
这是西西·哈珀特的洗礼仪式，整个办公室的人都来了，这让吉姆和帕姆感到很无奈。

14
00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:51.270
Michael is not the godfather, but during a post-christening reception with Too Little Food,
迈克尔不是教父，但在洗礼后的招待会上，因为食物太少，

15
00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:57.710
he is moved by the spirit of the church parishioners and impulsively joins a youth ministry trip to Mexico.
他被教堂教区居民的精神所感动，冲动之下决定参加一个去墨西哥的青年事工之旅。

16
00:00:58.510 --> 00:00:59.970
And Andy goes, too.
安迪也去了。

17
00:01:00.230 --> 00:01:03.410
I mean, the whole office shows up because Michael invited them.
我是说，整个办公室的人都来了，因为是迈克尔邀请他们的。

18
00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:04.170
Yes.
没错。

19
00:01:05.270 --> 00:01:06.410
Not Jim and Pam.
不是吉姆和帕姆邀请的。

20
00:01:07.010 --> 00:01:07.450
Michael.
是迈克尔。

21
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:09.010
Michael invited them.
是迈克尔邀请他们的。

22
00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:12.350
And they didn't know better not to come.
而他们也没意识到不该去。

23
00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:12.970
I know.
我知道。

24
00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:17.830
Like, aren't you like, huh, weird that Jim and Pam didn't invite me, but Michael did.
就好像，难道你们不会觉得奇怪吗？吉姆和帕姆没邀请我，但迈克尔邀请了。

25
00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:18.530
I guess I'll go.
我想我还是去吧。

26
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:22.390
I mean, it's really sweet that everyone showed up, actually.
其实大家能来真的很贴心。

27
00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:25.190
It is, but I don't think Jim and Pam invited them.
确实，但我觉得吉姆和帕姆并没有邀请他们。

28
00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:30.390
Fast fact number one, both our writer and our director are new on this episode.
第一个速览事实，这一集的编剧和导演都是新面孔。

29
00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:30.850
Yeah.
没错。

30
00:01:31.130 --> 00:01:33.910
Let's start with our director, Alex Hardcastle.
先从我们的导演亚历克斯·哈德卡斯尔说起。

31
00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.890
He is a British television director and producer.
他是一位英国电视导演兼制片人。

32
00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:43.090
He has directed such shows as New Girl, The Mindy Project, Crazy Ex-Girlfriend, and Grace and Frankie.
他执导过《杰茜驾到》、《明迪烦事多》、《疯狂前女友》和《同妻俱乐部》等剧集。

33
00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:46.850
He was recommended by our executive producer, Howard Klein.
他是我们的执行制片人霍华德·克莱恩推荐的。

34
00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:48.810
And I remember him well.
我对他印象很深。

35
00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:50.310
He was delightful.
他非常讨人喜欢。

36
00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:51.710
He was so charming.
他特别有魅力。

37
00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:54.230
You guys, he had a really cute accent.
伙计们，他的口音真的很可爱。

38
00:01:54.770 --> 00:01:58.070
I mean, we were such suckers for the accents.
我是说，我们对这种口音完全没有抵抗力。

39
00:01:58.230 --> 00:01:59.210
Charles McDougal.
查尔斯·麦克道格尔。

40
00:01:59.290 --> 00:01:59.750
I know.
我知道。

41
00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:00.330
Idris.
伊德里斯。

42
00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:01.970
Alex Hardcastle.
亚历克斯·哈德卡斯尔。

43
00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:02.410
I know.
我知道。

44
00:02:03.030 --> 00:02:06.910
Randy said he worked with Alex on other productions after The Office, and he was always awesome.
兰迪说他在《办公室》之后还和其他制作组与亚历克斯合作过，他一直都很棒。

45
00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.510
Now, let's talk about Peter, our writer.
现在，来聊聊我们的编剧彼得。

46
00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:15.390
He was a new writer on staff with us for season seven, and he had previously written on Dead
他是第七季加入我们团队的新编剧，此前曾参与过《死神有约》

47
00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:21.130
Like Me and Pushing Daisies, and Peter was quoted in Andy Green's book about The Office,
和《灵指神探》的编剧工作，安迪·格林的《办公室》一书中曾引用过彼得的话，

48
00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:24.110
and he specifically talked about the christening episode.
他专门谈到了《洗礼》这一集。

49
00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.250
Oh, what'd he say?
哦，他说了什么？

50
00:02:25.430 --> 00:02:30.270
He said, quote, when I first started, they had this idea for a christening episode,
他说，引用原话，当我刚开始工作时，他们就有了一个关于洗礼剧集的想法，

51
00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:34.190
which is as unsexy an episode as you can possibly pitch.
这大概是你所能提出的最乏味的一集剧情了。

52
00:02:35.290 --> 00:02:39.650
And when they brought it up, the entire room looked at me because I had a lot of kids.
当他们提起这件事时，整个房间的人都看向我，因为我有很多孩子。

53
00:02:39.910 --> 00:02:40.890
And that's true.
事实确实如此。

54
00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:42.910
He had five kids.
他有五个孩子。

55
00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:43.870
He has a big family.
他有一个大家庭。

56
00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:48.190
And then he said, I think the thought was, we'll let him write it.
然后他说，我想当时的想法是，就让他来写这一集吧。

57
00:02:48.470 --> 00:02:54.090
And I felt this sense of, how do you keep what we all loved in Jim and Pam in this post-marriage,
我当时有一种感觉，就是在这个婚后、育后的世界里，

58
00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.270
post-baby world?
该如何保留我们大家在吉姆和帕姆身上所钟爱的一切呢？

59
00:02:55.830 --> 00:03:00.990
But he said they just tried to lean into it and acknowledge that The Office was as much of
但他表示，他们只是试着顺其自然，并承认《办公室》对于第七季的吉姆和帕姆来说，

60
00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:05.290
a family for Jim and Pam in season seven, as it was for Michael.
就像对迈克尔一样，也是一个大家庭。

61
00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:10.930
And so that's where they got the idea that in the christening episode, you would bring
所以这就是他们灵感的来源，在洗礼那一集里，

62
00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:12.330
The Office into that story.
把《办公室》的同事们带入到那个故事中去。

63
00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:12.990
Yeah.
没错。

64
00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:17.310
I can imagine your first writing assignment, the christening, to be a little tough.
我能想象你第一次写剧本的任务——洗礼那一集，应该挺难的。

65
00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:18.650
I love hearing all of that.
听到这些我很高兴。

66
00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:23.970
My memory of Peter is that he was so nice, and I was a big fan of Dead Like Me.
我对彼得的印象是他非常好，而且我是《死神有约》的忠实粉丝。

67
00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:27.510
So I was like, oh my gosh, that's such a cool show.
所以我当时想，天哪，那真是一部很酷的剧。

68
00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.730
And now we get one of the writers from that show.
现在我们竟然请到了那部剧的编剧之一。

69
00:03:29.970 --> 00:03:33.550
One of the fun parts about working in this industry is that you get to run into people
在这个行业工作最有趣的部分之一，就是你会遇到你崇拜的人，

70
00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:38.250
you're fans of, and you get to hear all the inside scoop about what went into making this
还能听到关于制作你所钟爱的电影或电视剧的幕后独家内幕。

71
00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.150
show or movie that you love so much.
你所钟爱的电影或电视剧。

72
00:03:40.330 --> 00:03:40.790
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

73
00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:42.590
Do you want Fast Fact 2?
想要听第二个速查事实吗？

74
00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:43.770
Can I guess what it is?
我能猜猜是什么吗？

75
00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:44.390
What is it?
是什么？

76
00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:49.210
Because we're becoming like that old married couple a little bit in the podcaSt.
因为我们在播客里越来越像那对老夫老妻了。

77
00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.330
Oh no, you know what I order for dinner?
噢不，你知道我晚餐点什么吗？

78
00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:50.910
Maybe.
也许吧。

79
00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:51.970
I'm going to guess.
我要猜猜看。

80
00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.030
Sam, you guess too.
山姆，你也猜猜。

81
00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:54.270
Okay, Fast Fact 2.
好的，第二个速查事实。

82
00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:58.270
I'm going to guess that it's a location breakdown of the church.
我猜是关于教堂的取景地介绍。

83
00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:01.810
History of christenings.
洗礼的历史。

84
00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:05.820
I do good guesses, I think.
我觉得我猜得挺准的。

85
00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:06.920
Angela is correct.
安吉拉猜对了。

86
00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:07.560
Is it?
真的吗？

87
00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.140
Yes.
是的。

88
00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:08.600
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

89
00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:13.400
We had a fan question from Faye B in New Hampshire who wanted to know, where were the
我们收到了一位来自新罕布什尔州的粉丝费伊·B的提问，她想知道，

90
00:04:13.400 --> 00:04:14.500
church scenes filmed?
教堂的场景是在哪里拍摄的？

91
00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:15.760
It was beautiful.
那地方很美。

92
00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:17.300
It was gorgeous.
确实美极了。

93
00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:23.280
We shot at Church of the Angels in Pasadena, and I want to give a shout out to this gal
我们是在帕萨迪纳的天使教堂拍摄的，我想向一位叫琳赛的姑娘和她的博客致敬，

94
00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:29.580
Lindsay and her blog, quote, I'm not a stalker, because she goes around to different like film
博客名字叫“我不是跟踪狂”，因为她经常去各种不同的电影

95
00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.900
and television locations.
和电视拍摄地。

96
00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:31.360
Okay.
好的。

97
00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:36.400
And then she writes a little history about them, and she pulled together all this cool
然后她会写一点关于这些地方的历史，她搜集了所有关于

98
00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.060
information on Church of the Angels.
天使教堂的很酷的信息。

99
00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:39.460
Let's hear it.
说来听听。

100
00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:45.020
So this church was built in 1889, and it is the oldest church in Pasadena.
这座教堂建于1889年，是帕萨迪纳最古老的教堂。

101
00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:48.100
It was built by Mrs. Frances E.
它是由弗朗西斯·E·坎贝尔·约翰斯顿夫人建造的，

102
00:04:48.280 --> 00:04:52.520
Campbell Johnston in memory of her husband, Alexander Robert
为了纪念她的丈夫亚历山大·罗伯特·坎贝尔·约翰斯顿，

103
00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:56.280
Campbell Johnston, who was one of the first settlers of Pasadena.
他是帕萨迪纳最早的定居者之一。

104
00:04:56.780 --> 00:05:03.940
He was British, and the church's design was based on Hornby St. Mary's Church in Surrey.
他是英国人，教堂的设计是以萨里郡的霍恩比圣玛丽教堂为蓝本的。

105
00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:08.840
I was going to say, it looks like an old sort of English country church.
我正想说，它看起来就像那种古老的英国乡村教堂。

106
00:05:09.020 --> 00:05:12.480
I thought you were going to say, it looks like Hornby St. Mary's.
我还以为你会说，它看起来像霍恩比圣玛丽教堂呢。

107
00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:14.780
Yeah, definitely.
是啊，绝对像。

108
00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:18.940
That would have been funnier, but it really did when I was looking at it.
那样说会更有趣，但我看的时候确实是那么觉得的。

109
00:05:19.020 --> 00:05:21.300
I was like, oh, all the old stone and all of that.
我当时心想，噢，那些古老的石头之类的东西。

110
00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:21.740
Yeah.
没错。

111
00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:27.820
Well, speaking of stone, the very first cornerstone of the church was laid in place by Frances
说到石头，这座教堂的第一块基石就是由弗朗西斯本人

112
00:05:27.820 --> 00:05:28.380
herself.
亲手安放的。

113
00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:33.280
It's an Episcopalian church, and I don't know if you remember this, Ange, but there's
这是一座圣公会教堂，安吉，不知道你还记不记得，

114
00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:36.280
a large pipe organ inside the church.
教堂里有一架大型管风琴。

115
00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:37.200
It is functional.
它现在还能用。

116
00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:42.320
It was built in 1889 by the Roosevelt Organ Works in New York City.
它是由纽约市的罗斯福管风琴工厂于1889年建造的。

117
00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:46.600
This church has been featured in a lot of film and television.
这座教堂曾在许多影视作品中出镜。

118
00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:50.980
It has appeared on Knott's Landing, which is why Lindsay stalked it.
它在《诺氏登陆》中出现过，这也是琳赛追踪它的原因。

119
00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.660
She was a Knott's Landing fan.
她是《诺氏登陆》的粉丝。

120
00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:58.360
It has also appeared on Desperate Housewives, The X-Files, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, The
它还出现在《绝望主妇》、《X档案》、《吸血鬼猎人巴菲》、《白宫风云》、

121
00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:05.900
West Wing, Jag, the Mick Jagger God Gave Me Everything I Want music video, the movies Just
《执法悍将》、米克·贾格尔的音乐录影带《上帝赐予我想要的一切》，以及电影《新婚告急》、

122
00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.500
Married, Heathers, and of course, The Office.
《希德姐妹帮》，当然还有《办公室》。

123
00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:08.580
Yes.
没错。

124
00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:12.420
That church has a longer resume than I do.
那座教堂的履历比我还丰富。

125
00:06:13.560 --> 00:06:14.600
That's impressive.
真是令人印象深刻。

126
00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:20.520
And incidentally, our base camp with all our trailers was in the Rose Bowl parking lots.
顺便提一下，我们所有拖车所在的基地就在玫瑰碗球场的停车场里。

127
00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.160
Well, I loved that location breakdown.
我很喜欢那个外景地介绍。

128
00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:24.260
Thank you.
谢谢。

129
00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.740
Thank you, Lindsay, for blogging about it.
谢谢你，琳赛，感谢你写了关于它的博客。

130
00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:27.880
Couldn't find your last name.
没能找到你的姓氏。

131
00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:35.600
Fast fact number three is all about our amazing guest star, Zoe Jarman, who played Carla.
第三个速览事实是关于我们出色的客串明星佐伊·贾曼，她饰演了卡拉。

132
00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:36.420
Carla!
卡拉！

133
00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:37.460
Carla.
卡拉。

134
00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:43.900
I mean, when she popped up, I immediately started giggling because we were so taken with
我是说，当她出现时，我立刻就开始咯咯笑，因为我们在拍摄时

135
00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:44.860
her when we were shooting.
就被她深深吸引了。

136
00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:48.200
She was so fantastic in her scenes with Steve.
她在和史蒂夫的对手戏中表现得太棒了。

137
00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:49.720
She held him toe to toe.
她完全接得住他的戏。

138
00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:53.440
Zoe, I was so excited to re-watch these scenes.
佐伊，我非常兴奋能重温这些场景。

139
00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:59.040
I could not find Zoe on Instagram or Twitter or anywhere social media.
我在Instagram、Twitter或任何社交媒体上都找不到佐伊。

140
00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:00.660
Respect, Zoe.
致敬，佐伊。

141
00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:04.880
Whenever I can't find somebody, I'm always like, oh, they're a real actor.
每当我找不到某个人时，我总是会想，噢，他们是真正的演员。

142
00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:06.460
I do.
我也是。

143
00:07:06.940 --> 00:07:09.380
And so I could not slide into her DMs.
