And that way, if things are going down, you know it's nighttime and not the morning.
这样一来，如果发生什么事，你就知道是晚上而不是早上。

238
00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:57.600
Yeah.
是啊。

239
00:10:58.820 --> 00:10:59.300
Okay.
好的。

240
00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:00.400
Here's what it said.
它是这样写的。

241
00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:00.800
Okay.
好的。

242
00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:02.920
7.42 p.m.
晚上7点42分。

243
00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:04.320
It's official.
正式宣布。

244
00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:06.540
Cece is a member of the covenant community.
西西现在是圣约社区的一员了。

245
00:11:06.760 --> 00:11:09.680
The baptism ceremony was beautiful, mostly.
