我找到我的一本日记了。

266
00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:54.500
All right.
好吧。

267
00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:55.640
We're going to take a break.
我们要休息一下。

268
00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:56.000
Uh-huh.
嗯哼。

269
00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.760
We're going to come back and break down this episode.
我们回来后会深入解析这一集。

270
00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:01.120
And at some point, Angela will be getting out her journal.
到时候，安吉拉会拿出她的日记。

271
00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.120
Oh, I can see it.
噢，我能想象得到。

272
00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:04.420
I can see it.
我能想象得到。

273
00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:05.620
I just took it out.
我刚把它拿出来。

274
00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:06.200
What nugget.
