我们马上回来。

287
00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:44.040
This episode starts with Pam in her role as office administrator.
这一集开头是帕姆以办公室行政主管的身份出场。

288
00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:47.760
And she is leading a conference room meeting all about hygiene.
她正在会议室主持一场关于卫生的会议。

289
00:12:48.180 --> 00:12:49.680
Yeah, and she's got a big sign.
没错，她还拿了个大牌子。

290
00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:52.540
If you go to 12 seconds, it says Saber Hygiene Day.
如果你看到12秒处，上面写着“赛博卫生日”。

291
00:12:53.260 --> 00:12:53.780
Semicolon.
分号。

292
00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:56.720
Simple steps to a cleaner working environment.
营造更清洁工作环境的简单步骤。

293
00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.760
Always wash your hands.
务必洗手。

294
00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.440
Remember to get your flu shot.
记得去打流感疫苗。

295
00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.680
Wipe down your desk daily.
每天擦拭你的办公桌。

296
00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:05.220
Stay home when you are sick or contagious.
生病或有传染性时请待在家里。

297
00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:08.000
Use the hand sanitizing station often.
经常使用洗手消毒站。

298
00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:14.380
Dwight isn't happy about the hand sanitizing stations or any of these suggestions, really.
德怀特对洗手消毒站或者这些建议其实都不太满意。

299
00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:21.160
He says that the best way to not get sick is to be exposed to germs, and he would like a hand desanitizing station.
他说不生病的最好方法是接触细菌，他还想要一个“手部去消毒站”。

300
00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:25.140
Did you hear what he wants in his hand desanitizing station?
你听见他想要在他的手部去消毒站里放什么了吗？

301
00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:27.440
No, I missed it.
不，我错过了。

302
00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:34.960
He wants, and I quote, a simple bowl at every juncture filled with dirt, vomit, fecal matter.
他想要，我引用一下，在每一个连接处都放一个装满泥土、呕吐物和排泄物的简单碗。

303
00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:35.580
Oh, God.
天哪。

304
00:13:35.760 --> 00:13:36.820
