00:27:02.760 --> 00:27:04.760
And that baby was so distracting.
那个婴儿太让人分心了。

623
00:27:04.760 --> 00:27:07.160
And I feel like he was doing a really good performance.
我觉得他演得其实非常好。

624
00:27:07.180 --> 00:27:09.220
But all I could look at was this Jelly Baby.
但我满眼看到的都是那个“果冻婴儿”。

625
