00:28:03.780 --> 00:28:09.100
show up, and so they had to just use fake baby and do their beSt.
为什么要删掉那条推文呢？

643
00:28:09.300 --> 00:28:10.640
Why do you have to delete that tweet?
那只是信息而已。

644
00:28:10.820 --> 00:28:11.960
That's just information.
我不知道。

645
00:28:12.300 --> 00:28:13.120
I don't know.
我猜可能是因为他不适合去解释为什么会有假婴儿吧。

646
00:28:13.120 --> 00:28:18.820
I guess maybe it was like not his place to say why there was a fake baby.
我不知道。

647
00:28:18.940 --> 00:28:19.360
I don't know.
或者可能是制片方说：“别提那个假婴儿的事。”

648
00:28:19.480 --> 00:28:22.060
Or maybe the studio was like, don't call out the fake baby.
没错，正是这样。

649
00:28:22.260 --> 00:28:23.340
Yeah, exactly.
别再提那个假婴儿了。

650
00:28:23.660 --> 00:28:24.640
Enough with the fake baby.
别再提那个假婴儿了。

651
00:28:24.840 --> 00:28:30.420
I loved that clip from the news so much because I loved how many different stings were in there,
我特别喜欢那段新闻片段，因为我喜欢里面用到的各种转场音效，

