00:28:36.420 --> 00:28:37.260
Was there a helicopter?
里面有直升机吗？

656
00:28:37.800 --> 00:28:39.700
It was like a zoo time radio morning.
听起来就像那种早间广播节目。

657
00:28:39.920 --> 00:28:41.000
There were so many things.
音效实在太多了。

658
00:28:41.500 --> 00:28:44.560
Well, I have a great photo of our jelly baby.
对了，我有一张我们那个软糖宝宝的照片。

659
00:28:44.800 --> 00:28:46.180
It was in between scenes.
那是拍摄间隙拍的。

