00:29:29.920 --> 00:29:31.580
Also, Jim Dever sings.
还有，吉姆·德弗唱歌了。

678
00:29:31.780 --> 00:29:32.720
He's laughing with Pam.
他在和帕姆一起笑。

679
00:29:33.980 --> 00:29:35.180
Oh, okay.
哦，好吧。

680
00:29:35.620 --> 00:29:36.500
Good catch.
