Wait, it's a Game of Thrones.
没错。

723
00:31:03.850 --> 00:31:04.410
Yeah.
这是《权力的游戏》主题拆信刀。

724
00:31:04.630 --> 00:31:06.350
It's a Game of Thrones letter opener.
天哪。

725
00:31:06.490 --> 00:31:07.010
Oh, my gosh.
这是长爪剑拆信刀。

726
00:31:07.130 --> 00:31:10.490
It is the Longclaw Sword letter opener.
没错。

727
00:31:10.890 --> 00:31:11.450
Yes.
太棒了。

728
00:31:12.230 --> 00:31:12.450
Yay.
凛冬将至，你的信件也随之而来。

