This is one of the most thoughtful gifts you've ever given me in all of our friendship.
据我所知，他们并没有把艾莉亚的剑做成拆信刀。

735
00:31:35.810 --> 00:31:40.570
They don't, from what I know, make Aria's sword into a letter opener.
