所以我希望这把长爪剑好用。

740
00:31:49.530 --> 00:31:53.110
So I hope that this Longclaw sword is good.
是的，我太喜欢了。

741
00:31:53.590 --> 00:31:54.550
Yes, I love it.
我会给它拍张照，然后开心地用它拆信。

742
00:31:54.610 --> 00:31:57.790
I will take a picture of it, and I will open mail happily with it.
嗯哼。

743
00:31:57.870 --> 00:31:58.130
Mm-hmm.
我们的邮件里一直提到的一个问题。

744
00:31:58.770 --> 00:32:00.590
Something that keeps coming up in our mail.
我正举着我的拆信刀呢。

745
00:32:00.710 --> 00:32:02.410
I'm holding up my letter opener.
嗯哼。

746
00:32:02.830 --> 00:32:03.130
Mm-hmm.
我们的邮件里一直提到的一个问题是，Office Ladies 接下来要做什么？

747
00:32:03.130 --> 00:32:07.010
Something that keeps coming up in our mail is, what is next for office ladies?
我们接下来要做什么？

748
00:32:07.470 --> 00:32:08.710
What are we doing next?
我们要成为“谷歌女士”吗？

749
00:32:08.910 --> 00:32:11.750
Are we going to be ladies who Google?
我们要成为“妈妈侦探”吗？

