Oh, this has gotten bigger.
噢，这规模变大了。

770
00:32:44.790 --> 00:32:46.790
I thought we were going to be in your garage again.
我还以为我们要回到你的车库里录呢。

771
00:32:46.890 --> 00:32:47.830
But yes, you're right.
不过是的，你说得对。

772
00:32:47.890 --> 00:32:48.370
