1120
00:47:12.180 --> 00:47:14.260
I haven't accomplished a great deal yet.
我目前还没取得什么大成就。

1121
00:47:14.280 --> 00:47:16.720
Or I have accomplished a lot.
又或者我已经成就斐然了。

1122
