And thank you, James Carey, for sending me over those call sheets.
也谢谢你，詹姆斯·凯里，把那些通告单发给我。

1424
01:00:57.160 --> 01:00:59.220
Sam and Cassie, you guys are the beSt.
山姆和卡西，你们真是太棒了。

1425
01:00:59.240 --> 01:01:01.360
Thanks for sitting through my journal entry.
感谢你们听我念完我的日记。

1426
01:01:01.600 --> 01:01:04.400
And Jenna, I can't wait to open letters with my letter opener.
还有珍娜，我迫不及待想用我的拆信刀拆信了。

1427
01:01:05.020 --> 01:01:06.620
I can't wait to watch you do it.
我迫不及待想看你拆信的样子了。

1428
01:01:06.660 --> 01:01:07.580
It will bring me joy.
那会给我带来快乐。

1429
01:01:07.580 --> 01:01:09.320
Have a great week, you guys.
祝大家这周过得愉快。

1430
01:01:09.440 --> 01:01:10.280
We'll see you next time.
我们下次见。

1431
01:01:15.940 --> 01:01:17.480
